### ParrePOS Requests - Cobertura por waves
# Wave 1: auth/me, customers/items/invoices (ver docs/api.md para contrato completo)
# Wave 2 (incluye 2.1/2.2): POS, caja, cash movements, sync, handshake/status
# Wave 3-4: fiscal opcional, documentos, retries, metricas, webhook
# Wave 5: ops metrics/conflicts, inventario integrado y hardening smoke

### Health
GET http://localhost/health

### Login
POST http://localhost/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_slug": "demo",
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: status
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: config OFF (default no fiscal)
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fiscal": {
    "enabled": false,
    "dgii_registered": false,
    "ncf_type": "B01",
    "series": "B01",
    "provider": "MOCK",
    "provider_url": "",
    "signing_secret": ""
  }
}

### Fiscal: config ON (requiere DGII true)
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fiscal": {
    "enabled": true,
    "dgii_registered": true,
    "ncf_type": "B01",
    "series": "B01",
    "provider": "MOCK",
    "provider_url": "",
    "signing_secret": "tenant-secret-demo",
    "emission_limits": {
      "daily_max": 0,
      "monthly_max": 0
    }
  },
  "profile": {
    "legal_name": "Demo Fiscal SRL",
    "rnc": "131452987",
    "environment": "CERT",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
  }
}

### Fiscal: listar documentos
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents?status=PENDING&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: buscar documentos
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/search?status=FAILED&ncf=B01&date_from=2026-02-01&date_to=2026-02-28&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: resumen documentos
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/summary?date_from=2026-02-01&date_to=2026-02-28
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: metricas operativas
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/metrics?date_from=2026-02-01&date_to=2026-02-28
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: documento por id
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: eventos documento
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/1/events?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: acks documento
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/1/acks?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: retry documento 1
POST http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: retry bulk
POST http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/documents/retry-bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Fiscal: webhook ack (con key)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/webhook/ack
Content-Type: application/json
X-Fiscal-Webhook-Key: dev-fiscal-key

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "fiscal_document_id": 1,
  "ack_code": "ACCEPTED",
  "ack_message": "Aceptado por DGII",
  "track_id": "DGII-DEMO-001"
}

### Backoffice fiscal (URL manual)
# Abrir en navegador:
# http://localhost/fiscal-backoffice.html

### POS: handshake
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/registers/handshake
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "demo-device-1",
  "app_version": "2.2.0",
  "capabilities": ["offline", "sync"]
}

### POS: crear sucursal
POST http://localhost/api/v1/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sucursal Centro",
  "address": "Av. Demo 123"
}

### POS: crear caja
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/registers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "name": "Caja 1",
  "device_id": "demo-device-1"
}

### POS: abrir caja
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-sessions/open
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "register_id": 1,
  "opening_amount": 1000
}

### POS: salida de caja (gasto)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: mov-001
X-Device-Id: demo-device-1

{
  "cash_session_id": 1,
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": 250,
  "reason_code": "EXPENSE",
  "description": "Compra de insumos",
  "reference": "R-1001"
}

### POS: salida de caja duplicada (esperado: ok=true, data.duplicate=true)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: mov-001
X-Device-Id: demo-device-1

{
  "cash_session_id": 1,
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": 250,
  "reason_code": "EXPENSE",
  "description": "Compra de insumos",
  "reference": "R-1001"
}

### POS: entrada de caja (deposito)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cash_session_id": 1,
  "type": "IN",
  "amount": 500,
  "reason_code": "DEPOSIT",
  "description": "Refuerzo de caja",
  "reference": "D-2001"
}

### POS: resumen movimientos
GET http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-movements/summary?cash_session_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### POS: reversar movimiento
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-movements/1/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Reverso por error"
}

### POS: venta pagada (mixta)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "register_id": 1,
  "cash_session_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {"item_id": 1, "name": "Cafe", "qty": 1, "unit_price": 1000, "discount": 0, "tax_rate": 0.18}
  ],
  "payments": [
    {"method": "CASH", "amount": 1000},
    {"method": "CARD", "amount": 180, "reference": "POS-001"}
  ]
}

### Inventory: movimiento manual IN
POST http://localhost/api/v1/inventory/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "item_id": 1,
  "movement_type": "IN",
  "qty": 20,
  "reason_code": "ADJUST"
}

### Inventory: stock por sucursal/item
GET http://localhost/api/v1/inventory/stock?branch_id=1&item_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Inventory: kardex
GET http://localhost/api/v1/inventory/kardex?branch_id=1&item_id=1&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### POS: venta HOLD
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/sales/1/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cliente pidio pausa"
}

### POS: venta RESUME
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/sales/1/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### POS: cerrar caja
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/cash-sessions/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closing_amount": 2180
}

### POS: sync status (permiso sync.read)
GET http://localhost/api/v1/sync/status?device_id=demo-device-1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### OPS: métricas tenant (permiso audit.read)
GET http://localhost/api/v1/ops/tenant-metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### OPS: conflictos de sync (permiso audit.read)
GET http://localhost/api/v1/ops/sync-conflicts?resolved=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### POS: sync offline (permiso sync.write)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/sync/events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "demo-device-1",
  "events": [
    {
      "event_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "op_id": "op-001",
      "device_id": "demo-device-1",
      "type": "pos.sale.paid",
      "idempotency_key": "idem-001",
      "payload": {
        "branch_id": 1,
        "register_id": 1,
        "cash_session_id": 1,
        "items": [
          {"name": "Pan", "qty": 1, "unit_price": 100, "discount": 0, "tax_rate": 0.18}
        ]
      },
      "ts": "2026-01-16T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### POS: sync offline duplicado (esperado status=duplicate por evento)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/sync/events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "demo-device-1",
  "events": [
    {
      "event_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "op_id": "op-001",
      "device_id": "demo-device-1",
      "type": "pos.sale.paid",
      "idempotency_key": "idem-001",
      "payload": {
        "branch_id": 1,
        "register_id": 1,
        "cash_session_id": 1,
        "items": [
          {"name": "Pan", "qty": 1, "unit_price": 100, "discount": 0, "tax_rate": 0.18}
        ]
      },
      "ts": "2026-01-16T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### POS: sync conflicto por op_id (esperado status=conflict)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/sync/events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "demo-device-1",
  "events": [
    {
      "event_id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "op_id": "op-conflict-001",
      "device_id": "demo-device-1",
      "type": "cash_movement.created",
      "idempotency_key": "idem-conflict-a",
      "payload": {
        "cash_session_id": 1,
        "type": "IN",
        "amount": 10,
        "reason_code": "DEPOSIT",
        "description": "A",
        "reference": "OP-A"
      },
      "ts": "2026-01-16T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### POS: sync conflicto por op_id (segundo evento payload distinto)
POST http://localhost/api/v1/sync/events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "demo-device-1",
  "events": [
    {
      "event_id": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
      "op_id": "op-conflict-001",
      "device_id": "demo-device-1",
      "type": "cash_movement.created",
      "idempotency_key": "idem-conflict-b",
      "payload": {
        "cash_session_id": 1,
        "type": "IN",
        "amount": 99,
        "reason_code": "DEPOSIT",
        "description": "B",
        "reference": "OP-B"
      },
      "ts": "2026-01-16T00:00:01Z"
    }
  ]
}

### NEGATIVO (manual): esperar TENANT_SUSPENDED
### 1) actualiza tenants.status='SUSPENDED' en DB
### 2) ejecuta este handshake
POST http://localhost/api/v1/pos/registers/handshake
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "negative-device",
  "app_version": "2.2.0",
  "capabilities": ["offline", "sync"]
}

